Package: inmetr
Title: Access Brazilian Automatic Weather Station Data
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: person("Vinicius", "Reginatto", email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download verified INMET automatic weather station data, query
    hourly and daily observations lazily with DuckDB, and find stations near
    Brazilian municipality seats.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/viniciusoike/inmetr
BugReports: https://github.com/viniciusoike/inmetr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
